      "So run the 2-minute test tonight. If your impressions are steady and your clicks fell, you don't have a rankings problem. You have an AI search problem, and the five fixes above are where it gets solved. Start with the free [website audit](/tools) to see exactly where your pages leak, and if you want the full system with worksheets and a 30-day plan, it is the one in [Website to Customers](/ebook). Your rankings didn't drop. Your clicks did. Now you know why — and what to do about it.",
